<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-02T00:56:13.442Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian Revolutionary Guard forces reported three tankers ablaze and mines striking four tankers in the Strait of Hormuz while Iran's foreign minister welcomed U.S. outreach during a Qatari mediation visit. Iran's supreme leader ordered the military to expand retaliation plans without geographic limits and the security chief debated discarding the nuclear weapons ban. Iranian envoys met Qatari mediators as the United States threatened strikes after the midterm elections, and Iran's strikes on U.S. Middle East bases disabled early-warning systems. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/703dd322-e880-4bbf-80f8-8b0efda1831c?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/31/world/middleeast/iran-war-israel-us-elections-trump-netanyahu.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/01/negotiators-braced-for-worst-over-us-iran-talks-to-reopen-strait-of-hormuz&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/30/irans-revolutionary-guard-reports-two-tankers-on-fire-in-strait-of-hormuz-as-talks-continu&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261102-iran-warns-renewed-war-with-us-could-outlast-previous-conflict&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/inside-story/2026/11/1/how-will-the-iran-war-shape-the-outcome-of-the-u-s-midterm-vote?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/efaa2962-1acb-45cf-afb4-d0088f0a1046?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google